  "description": "Alpe d'Huez is more than a climb in Le Tour. Helicopters, police escorts, blue smoke, screaming face-painters, and a crowd of 300,000 cycling fans guarantee that every visit to this legendary summit will be crowned forever in glory. It's this unmistakable marriage of history, spectacle, colossal effort, sportsmanship, and beauty that is woven into every Alpe d'Huez frame we make.\n\nAlpe d’Huez is the ultimate choice for cyclists who value the simplicity and elegance of rim brakes. Designed with a perfect balance of low weight and high efficiency, this frame offers the exceptional performance and comfort you expect from TIME. If you’re looking for a contemporary rim brake road frame, the Alpe d’Huez answers the call.\n\nReady to Paint\n\nTime framesets can be purchased unpainted in a prepped and sanded condition and with all hardware. Deliver the Ready to Paint frameset to the paint shop of your choosing to create the TIME of your dreams!\n\nWhat's Included\n\n• TIME Quickset® headset and compression plug",
